[00:38.732]The companion of love is hate
[00:55.100]The enemy of snow is the sun
[01:11.595]Like patting off the dust
[01:16.420]Drive off sorrow
[01:19.063]
[01:28.172]The end of darkness is light
[01:44.625]The end of life is oblivion
[02:01.290]Like welcoming the rising sun
[02:06.036]Welcome death
[02:11.483]
[02:18.065]Behold the snow, behold the the smoke of fires
[02:23.107]Behold love
[02:34.588]Forget you, forget me
[02:39.055]Forget the night before
[02:48.755]
[03:44.748]Dread not the change
[03:59.038]Time stands just before you
[04:13.804]Do not go missing in the past
[04:18.033]Do not go pacing back and forth
[04:25.936]
[04:28.890]Behold the snow
[04:30.341]Behold the smoke of fires
[04:33.089]Behold love
[04:43.230]Forget you
[04:44.895]Forget me
[04:47.456]Forget the night before
